  "description": "The Moraine C X0 Transmission is our carbon eMTB designed to extend your range on all-mountain terrain. FAZUA’s Ride 60 drive system delivers 60Nm assist and a 480Wh battery in a lightweight, discreet package — perfect for taking the edge off steep climbs or fast-forwarding through the flats to get to the good stuff.\n\nMoraine features 145mm rear and 160mm front suspension travel, with our Split Pivot suspension design tuned for excellent pedaling efficiency and predictable braking traction. Combined with our playful all-mountain geometry, it’s a setup that keeps you composed in the technical segments without ever feeling like a slog.\n\nMoraine’s e-assist opens up longer rides, so we’ve made it cargo-friendly, with a dedicated spot in the frame for your bottle, multi-tool, pump, and spare tube — no need for a hip pack. And with SRAM’s X0 Transmission groupset, you get quick, precision shifting and a wide gear range so you’re always in the right cadence for whatever the trail has in store.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
